WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.100
-So happy to have our friend
Fred Armisen back

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.167
and leading the band.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.534
How are you, Fred?
-I'm doing great.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.033
-I'm always so happy to see you,

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.968
and I'm always so impressed
because not only this show,

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.601
but you have so many other
products --

00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:14.934
projects and products.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:18.400
That's something I think
speaks to your range.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.968
-Yes.
-But you also are a bit...

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:23.434
you're a bit of a fashionista.

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:24.868
And I was really excited
to hear this,

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:28.400
that you're developing
a new summer shoe.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.234
-That's right.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:33.234
-So...
So I'm developing this shoe.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:34.767
-Yeah.
-And it's basically...

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.133
it's a sort of backpack, right?

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.868
So, like, you know
how you have to, like,

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:40.767
switch out your shoes
all the time?

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:42.400
-No, wait, when?
-So, like...

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.767
In life, you know,
you're always like,

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.667
"Oh, I got to put on my sneakers
or boots or whatever."

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.200
-Okay.
-So I've got this backpack

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.901
that's like a metal locker

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:50.601
and it's got all your,

00:00:50.601 --> 00:00:53.000
like, favorite
different types of shoes.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.067
And so you've got it with you.

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:58.234
But it's with --
It's like not in -- in sight.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:00:59.701
It's not in vision.

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:04.501
So behind your head, one, like
one locker piece is like that.

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:07.100
And then in your shoulders
it's like three shoes

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.200
and then just going down.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.367
So it follows your...
-So no one knows

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:11.567
you're carrying
all your shoes with you.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:13.701
-Nobody knows.
-Wow. So that's nice.

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:15.501
-You can just talk to someone.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:16.734
And so then you've got a code

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:20.234
so that there are no thieves,
and, you know...

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:23.300
-But a thief couldn't see it
because it's invis-- so what...

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.901
What is the fear
of how a thief would...?

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:27.434
-Because thieves are always
sort of like behind you.

00:01:27.434 --> 00:01:29.434
-Oh, I see. Yeah.
-And so...

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:30.834
So then you've got
a little combination

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:32.434
and you can put on
whatever shoes you want.

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.601
-Great.
-And, yeah, and that's it.

00:01:34.601 --> 00:01:36.133
They're free...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.667
...for...

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:40.367
every New Yorker,

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.601
every Californian,
everyone from Washington State.

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:43.934
They're free.
-How do you --

00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:45.367
How do you you make money, Fred?

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.133
-It doesn't -- That's --
It doesn't matter.

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:49.801
-Yeah.
-Do you know what I mean?

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.367
-What's it called?
Do you have a name for it?

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:54.734
-None. No name.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:57.400
-Congratulations.
-Thank you.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.300
-[ Indistinct ]

